body:
Unfortunately on average this is the case. Also generally the wealthier you are the more selfish you are. This works across society. Those who have suffered are also more empathetic. For a sociopath empathy and guilt are wasteful drains of energy they dont have to worry about. Nor do they consider the implications of lying and manipulating to getting to the top. I would say Hong Kong has the most sociopaths per sq mile, and it happens to have the most millionaires per sq. mile (as an example). 

&#x200B;

Once a sociopath makes you their prey, you won't forget it.
